  "fullContentHtml": "\n<div class=\"ast-post-format- single-layout-1 ast-no-date-box\" style=\"height: auto !important;\">\n\n<p><!-- .entry-header --></p>\n<div class=\"entry-content clear\" style=\"height: auto !important;\">\n<div class=\"post-desc\">\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>Short Information :</strong> <a style=\"color: #ff0000;\" href=\"https://uppsc.up.nic.in/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">Uttar Pradesh Public Service Commission (UPPSC)</a> </span>has released the notification for the Direct, Lecturer, Professor and Other Various Post. This recruitment has been issued for 36 posts. Online applying process for UPPSC Various Post Recruitment 2025 has started from 24 March 2025 &amp; the candidates can apply till 24 April 2025. Candidates must check the complete details for UPPSC Various Post Recruitment 2025 which has given below.&nbsp;</span></p><div class=\"code-block code-block-2\" style=\"margin: 8px 0; clear: both;\">\n\n<!-- SarkariExam Home page -->\n\n</div>\n\n</div>\n<div class=\"newtable1\">\n<table style=\"font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; width: 100%;\" width=\"100%\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\">Uttar Pradesh Public Service Commission (UPPSC)</span></h2>\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #008000;\">UPPSC Various Post Recruitment 2025</span></h2>\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\">UPPSC Advt No : D-1/E-1/2025 , 24/03/2025</span></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>Important Dates</b></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Application Start Date : <strong>24 March 2025</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Last Date : <span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>24 April 2025</strong></span></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Fee Payment Last Date : <strong>24 April 2025</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Correction Last Date :&nbsp;<strong>01 May 2025</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Exam Date : <strong>Notify Soon</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Admit Card : <strong>Before Exam</strong></span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>Application Fee</b></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">General, EWS, OBC <strong>: Rs. 105/-</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">SC, ST <strong>: Rs. 65/-</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">PH <strong>: Rs. 25/-</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Candidates have to pay their Examination Fee Through Debit Card / Credit Card / Net Banking / UPI and Other Fee Payment Mode Only.</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"></p><div class=\"code-block code-block-3\" style=\"margin: 8px 0; clear: both;\">\n\n<!-- SarkariExam Home page -->\n\n</div>\n<p></p><div class=\"code-block code-block-3\" style=\"margin: 8px 0; clear: both;\">\n\n<!-- SarkariExam Home page -->\n\n</div>\n\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>UPPSC Various Post Notification 2025 : Age Limit</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Age Limit As On 01 July 2025</span></strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Minimum Age :&nbsp;<strong>21 to 30 Years (Post Wise)</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Maximum Age :&nbsp;<strong>40 – 50 Years (Post Wise)</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Age Relaxation as per UPPSC Various Post Recruitment Rules.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Use <span style=\"color: #000000; background-color: #ffff00;\"> </span>Tool – </span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>UPPSC Various Post 2025 : Vacancy Details</strong></span></h3>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>Total Posts : 36 Posts</strong></span></p>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 60.9439%; text-align: center;\"><strong>Post Name</strong></td>\n<td style=\"width: 39.0561%; text-align: center;\"><strong>No. of Post</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 60.9439%; text-align: center;\">Assistant Architect,S-10/01</td>\n<td style=\"width: 39.0561%; text-align: center;\">02</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 60.9439%; text-align: center;\">Assistant Director Fisheries,S-02/01</td>\n<td style=\"width: 39.0561%; text-align: center;\">07</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 60.9439%; text-align: center;\">Research Officer,S-05/01</td>\n<td style=\"width: 39.0561%; text-align: center;\">01</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 60.9439%; text-align: center;\">Professor Kulliyat,S-11/06</td>\n<td style=\"width: 39.0561%; text-align: center;\">01</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 60.9439%; text-align: center;\">Lecturer (Pharmacy),S-08/01</td>\n<td style=\"width: 39.0561%; text-align: center;\">11</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 60.9439%; text-align: center;\">Professor Munafeul Aza,S-11/03</td>\n<td style=\"width: 39.0561%; text-align: center;\">01</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 60.9439%; text-align: center;\">Lecturer Ilmul Saidla,S-11/04</td>\n<td style=\"width: 39.0561%; text-align: center;\">01</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 60.9439%; text-align: center;\">Lecturer Ilmul Advia,S-11/05</td>\n<td style=\"width: 39.0561%; text-align: center;\">01</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 60.9439%; text-align: center;\">Reader Homoeopathic Materia Medica,S-11/01</td>\n<td style=\"width: 39.0561%; text-align: center;\">08</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 60.9439%; text-align: center;\">Reader Homoeopathic Pharmacy,S-11/02</td>\n<td style=\"width: 39.0561%; text-align: center;\">03</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>UPPSC Various Post Bharti 2025 : Educational Qualification</b></span></h3>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 28.933%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\"><b>Post Name</b></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 71.067%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\"><b>Eligibility</b></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 28.933%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Assistant Architect,S-10/01</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 71.067%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Candidates having Graduation Degree in Architecture from Any Recognized University in India.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Age Limit : 21-40 Years</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 28.933%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Assistant Director Fisheries,S-02/01</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 71.067%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Candidates having Post Graduation Degree in Zoology with Specialization in Fisheries.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Candidates having Post Graduation Degree in Fisheries Science.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Candidates having Graduation Degree in Fisheries Science.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Age Limit : 21-40 Years</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 28.933%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Research Officer,S-05/01</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 71.067%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Candidates having Post Graduation Degree in Maths OR Mathematical Statistics OR Commerce OR Economics OR Statistics with 50% Marks. OR PG Diploma in Statistics</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Age Limit : 21-40 Years</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 28.933%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Professor Kulliyat,S-11/06</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 71.067%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Candidates having 5 Year Degree in Unani with 10 Year Teaching Experience.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Age Limit : 30-50 Years</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 28.933%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Lecturer (Pharmacy),S-08/01</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 71.067%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Candidates having Post Graduation Degree in Related Subject from Any Recognized University in India.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Age Limit : 21-40 Years</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 28.933%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Professor Munafeul Aza,S-11/03</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 71.067%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Candidates having 5 Year Degree in Unani with 10 Year Teaching Experience.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Age Limit : 30-50 Years</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 28.933%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Lecturer Ilmul Saidla,S-11/04</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 71.067%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Candidates having 5 Year Degree in Unani.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Master Degree in Related Subject</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Adequate Knowledge of Hindi / English and urdu OR Arabic OR Persian</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Age Limit : 25-40 Years</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 28.933%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Lecturer Ilmul Advia,S-11/05</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 71.067%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Candidates having 5 Year Degree in Unani.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Master Degree in Related Subject</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Adequate Knowledge of Hindi / English and urdu OR Arabic OR Persian</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Age Limit : 25-40 Years</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 28.933%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Reader Homoeopathic Materia Medica,S-11/01</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 71.067%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Candidates having Post Graduation Degree in Homeopathy with 4 Year Teaching Experience.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Age Limit : 28-45 Years</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 28.933%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Reader Homoeopathic Pharmacy,S-11/02</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 71.067%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Candidates having Post Graduation Degree in Homeopathy with 4 Year Teaching Experience.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Age Limit : 28-45 Years</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>UPPSC Various Post Online Form 2025 : How To Apply</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Candidates can apply through link https://uppsc.up.nic.in/ or provided below in link section or they can also apply through official site of the UPPSC before Last Date.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">You Can Check other <a style=\"color: #000000;\" href=\"https://www.sarkariexam.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Sarkari Result 2025</a> Notification Here – <a style=\"color: #000000;\" href=\"https://www.sarkariexam.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Check Now.</a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">For all the interested and eligible candidates who want to apply for UPPSC Various Post recruitment can read all the information related to the recruitment is given below and the link to apply is given in the Important Link section below.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>UPPSC Various Post Recruitment 2025 : Mode of Selection</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Written Exam</span></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Interview</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Document Verification</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"></p><div class=\"code-block code-block-3\" style=\"margin: 8px 0; clear: both;\">\n\n<!-- SarkariExam Home page -->\n\